[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36m\u001b[1m|  Running: Demo 45: Ruby/Sinatra + PostgreSQL                       |\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m+====================================================================+\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m\r\nDemonstrates minimal Ruby app with PostgreSQL:\r\n  - Docker-based deployment\r\n  - PostgreSQL addon for data storage\r\n  - Tests Ruby + PostgreSQL connectivity\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
